menu "Yaykit cloud"

config YK_CLOUD_ORIGIN
    string "Device API origin"
    default "https://device.yaykit.io"
    help
        Origin of the device API (services/device). Yaykit has one environment since 2026-10-17. Until
        image signing ships (docs/architecture/device-platform.md 6.2), cloud firmware goes only to
        internal test builds, not public releases.

config YK_CLOUD_HTTP_BUFFER_MIN
    int "Smallest HTTP buffer, in bytes"
    default 0
    help
        An HTTPS client's receive and send buffers are at least this. 0 leaves them as written (2 KB or less, in internal
        RAM). Set it above CONFIG_SPIRAM_MALLOC_ALWAYSINTERNAL to have them in PSRAM: about 3.5 KB less internal RAM for
        each request. With a limit above it (16384, some firmware here) they stay internal and only grow.

endmenu
